# Keep the build context small and secret-free. Mirrors .gitignore, plus things an image never needs.
.git
.github
.changeset
.claude
.turbo
.vscode
.idea

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Secrets must never reach a build context, layer or image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.aws
**/secrets
**/*.tfstate*
**/*.tfvars

.data
tmp
docs
**/*.md
# What the image carries of the repository itself: its license, and the console's own pack
# served from the image, its manifest, skills and docs (deploy/Dockerfile, ADR-0031). An
# exception below a rule wins over it.
!LICENSE.md
!SKILLCDN.md
!skills/**
!docs/**
